{'symbol': 'PAYC', 'date': '2023-02-07 16:05:00', 'title': 'PAYCOM SOFTWARE, INC. REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND YEAR-END 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'OKLAHOMA CITY--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PAYCOM SOFTWARE, INC. (“PAYCOM,” “WE” AND “OUR”) (NYSE: PAYC), A LEADING PROVIDER OF COMPREHENSIVE, CLOUD-BASED HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE QUARTER AND YEAR ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022.'}